     "username": "FrankPP",
     "created_at": "2026-10-04T20:33:22.216Z",
     "cooked": "<p>Could someone please tell me how my form looks on the hyperextensions?</p>\n<p>My primary goal is to target the hamstrings. Personally, I\u2019d say I should keep my legs a bit straighter and avoid bending them so much. Other than that, I\u2019m pretty happy with my technique :).</p>\n<p>But as they say, two sets of eyes are better than one!</p>\n<div class=\"youtube-onebox lazy-video-container\" data-video-id=\"zYZU2vaXArY\" data-video-title=\"-\" data-video-start-time=\"\" data-video-list-id=\"\" data-provider-name=\"youtube\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zYZU2vaXArY\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"video-thumbnail\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">\n    <img class=\"youtube-thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/zYZU2vaXArY/maxresdefault.jpg\" title=\"-\" width=\"707\" height=\"397\">\n  </a>\n</div>\n",
