     "created_at": "2026-10-04T21:06:34.877Z",
     "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"FrankPP\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"294806\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/f/9de0a6/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> FrankPP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>My primary goal is to target the hamstrings.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>You could add a little hamstring involvement by flexing your hamstrings so your hips rise off of the pad.</p>",
